      "rules": [
        "Ride height follows the sim's y position, so the bike reads as floating on the water plane.",
        "The jet flames lengthen with speed and are the main speed cue.",
        "Tilt the hull by the sim's drift angle, clamped so it never looks broken."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-field",
